# MGA-Glide master API table. One line per exported Glide 2.x function.
# name | return | arguments | tier | used-by | status
# tier: 1 = needed to start, 2 = state/texturing used by games, 3 = logged stub first.
# used-by: g = GTA COMPFX.EXE, s = Screamer Rally STRT3FX.EXE (import lists, not call traces).
# status: stub | partial | done. The decorated export is _<NAME>@<4*nargs>, uppercase.
